1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 12. Margrethe Pedersdtr. Trane b. ABT 1583 Æ18, m. Christen Lauritsen Lind, (son of Lauritz Christensen Lind Æ18 and Karen Hansdtr. Æ18 _____) occupation Sogneprest, HÂ, 1618-1639, d. 1639, JÊrenÆ18.
