1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 16284 i. Tolleiv* BJØRNSSON Norheim. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Margrethe BJØRNSDATTER Norheim(714) (715) (705) was born about 1570 in Norheim farm #49, Etne, Hordaland, Norway. She died in 1643 in Augland farm #8, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1624, Kari Lauritsdatter Galtung, the widow of Jakob Jørstad, declared an intention to live with Margrethe Bjørnsdatter in her old age. In return Kari offered to give Margrethe a quarter of all her chattels and real estate. It 
2 CONC is unknown whether this transaction ever transpired.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT (Research):From GEDCOM file of Greg Hagen - 1996:
2 CONT In 1624, Kari Lauritsdatter Galtung, the widow of Jakob
2 CONT Jørstad,  declared an intention to live with Margrethe
2 CONT Bjørnsdatter in her old age.  In return Kari offered to
2 CONT give Margrethe a quarter of all her chattels and real
2 CONT estate.  It is unknown whether this transaction ever
2 CONT transpired.
2 CONT
