1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ID: I3363 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Bjorn Olsen AUKLAND 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1610 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: ABT 1687 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ola Jonsen TOTLAND b: ABT 1568 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Margrete Bjornsdatter NORHEIM b: ABT 1570 in Grindheim, Etne, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Kari Gudmundsdatter FOSEN b: ABT 1610 in Karmøy, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT *Gudmund Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1644 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Ola Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1647 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Lars Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1650 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Marta Bjornsdatter AUKLAND b: ABT 1635 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Sofia Bjornsdatter AUKLAND b: ABT 1640 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Borild Bjornsdatter AUKLAND b: ABT 1645 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Ole Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1650 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Jonas Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1660 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Jonas Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1666 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT *Gudmund Bjornsen AUKLAND b: ABT 1646 in Hjelmeland parish, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Bjørn Olson er nevnt som bruker fra 1639. Han fikk skjøte i 1671. Skifte blei holdt i 1687. Bjørn Olson var stor jordeier som far sin.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Nemnd som brukar på Aukland frå 1639. Han og faren må ha brukt garden saman ei tid før Bjørn overtok alt..Stor jordeigar, slik som faren. Fekk skøyte i 1671 frå arvingane til eldste broren, Tollak Jonson.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gift med Kari Gudmundsdatter. De bodde på Aukland, Ombo, Hjelmeland, Rogaland. De hadde gården fra 1639. Den første tiden sammen med faren, men alene etter hvert. (Hjelmeland. Gard og folk, 1. Gardane på nordsida av Randøy, på Omb
2 CONC o, Jøsneset og i Jøsenfjorden. s. 105.)
2 CONT Han hadde store eiendommer, og noen av dem var nok arv etter kona Karis far, Gudmund Toresen på Fosen, en av de største jordeierne i distriktet i sin tid.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT (Research):!Probate:  17 Mar 1687,     Hjelmeland, Norway
2 CONT Probate Surety:2
2 CONT From GEDCOM file of Greg Hagen - 1996:
2 CONT Bjørn Olavsson operated a farm at Aukland from at least
2 CONT 1639 and  worked in partnership with his father.  He took
2 CONT over the entire farm when his father died in 1652 and was
2 CONT
2 CONT one of the largest landowners of his time in Hjelmeland.
2 CONT Bjørn inherited 6 laupar smør from his parents when their
2 CONT property was  probated on 23 Jul 1655.  Bjørn's eldest
2 CONT brother, who was a priest, inherited Aukland, but by 1661,
2 CONT Bjørn owned about 10 laupar smør at 14 other farms.  His
2 CONT wife inherited a considerable estate from her father in
2 CONT 1670, which increased the size of his estate to 16 3/4
2 CONT laupar smør.
2 CONT He received a deed to Aukland and Indre Skår in 1671 when
2 CONT he bought 2 1/2  laup from the heirs of his brother for 380
2 CONT dalar.
2 CONT In 1660, Bjørn sued one of his tenants for breach of
2 CONT contract.  Among  other things, the tenant kept sheep, cut
2 CONT timber to the detriment of the forest, stripped birchbark
2 CONT and built a house.
2 CONT
2 CONT From GEDCOM file of Greg Hagen - 1996:
2 CONT Sex Surety:2
