1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Hans Jensen was born about 1661, in Rutsker, Bornholm, Denmark, his father, Jens Ibsen Jepsen, was 61 and his mother, Karen Jensdatter, was 41. He married Kirstine Hansdatter about 1678, in Bornholm, Denmark. 
2 CONC They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. He died in October 1716, in his hometown, at the age of 55, and was buried in Rutsker, Bornholm, Denmark.
