1 NAME Anne Kristine /Greve/
2 GIVN Anne Kristine
2 SURN Greve
2 _MARNM Greve
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1721
2 PLAC Bergen
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 26 FEB 1823
