2 CONC l ho døydde i 1733.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Lars Larsson, b. 1635, d. 1722, b. 1660 m. Siri Steinsdtr. Jelsa, born 1635, died 12 March 1733, nearly 99 years old. Lars was the son of Lars Asgautson and his first wife, Siri Olsdtr. Sigrid was the daughter of the peasant ch
