1 NAME Nils Rasmusson /Utsola/
2 GIVN Nils Rasmusson
2 SURN Utsola
2 _MARNM Utsola
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1668
2 PLAC Utsola bruk 1 Sola s452 nr 4.4
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
