1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hans Schreuder Leganger''', Sognepræst til [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eidsvoll Eidsvold].
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans was the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Erik-Leganger/6000000002893822470 Erik Iversen Leganger] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Maren-Leganger/6000000001169124844 Maren Agnete Hansdatter Schreuder].
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Wife 1===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/people/Karen-Lind-Schultz/6000000002893822491 Karen Lind Schultz]
2 CONT
