2 CONT # Anna Louise Leganger f. 1730.
2 CONT # Mette Christine Leganger f. 1731
2 CONT # Agnete Catharine Bassøe Leganger f. 1734, d. 15 mar 1774, Eidsvold.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Wife 2===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/people/Margrethe-Munthe/6000000000905972872 Margrethe Marie Munthe], married on the 3 August 1739, in Hafslo, Luster, Sogn og Fjordane, Norway
2 CONT
