2 CONT
2 CONT Friederich GRÜNER B:  abt 1618/20 Deutschland  D:  9 Aug 1674 Christiania, Christiania, Akershus, Norge  Bu:  24 Jul 1674 Aker, Oslo, Oslo, Norge  M:  24 Jul 1653 Christiania, Christiania, Akershus, Norge 
2 CONT
