1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *  Born about 1689 in Aarestrup, Aalborg, Denmark. She died on 29 Mar 1754. She was buried on 29 Mar 1754 in Buderup, Aarestrup, Aalborg, Denmark. She married Peder Jacobsen DEICHMANN about 1704 in <Aardstrup, , Aa
2 CONC lborg, Denmark>.
2 CONT
