2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	i 	Jacob Pedersen Pedersen DEICHMANN 1 was born on 2 Nov 1710 in Aarestrup, Aalborg, Denmark. He died on 20 May 1771 in Lerup, Hjorring, Denmark. He was buried on 31 May 1771.
