2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	v 	Else Pedersen DEICHMANN 1 was born about 1724 in Aarestrup, Aalborg, Denmark. She died on 22 Aug 1775 in Haasum, Denmark. She was buried 2 on 30 Aug 1775 in Haasum, Viborg, Denmark.
2 CONT
